  "summary": "The saved mask comes from C9: compute_climatology_and_thresholds is called on the full-domain dataset (C9:L250). It produces one spatially pooled 366-day threshold; non-leap baseline years use strftime %j, which shifts the day of year by one after February. The threshold is smoothed over \u00b115 days, so raw days 138\u2013259 feed target day-of-year indices 153\u2013244, and those raw days pool baseline dates with day of year 133\u2013264. Every region sea cell's 2012-06-01..2012-08-31 values are compared against this threshold in find_mhws_in_region, and the result is written at C9:L299."
